Z||000001||maryjane||12-01-2001||05:36 PM||||Can't speak for them directly, but a lotof them 'learned' from neccessity. Either the product wasn't available anywhere else, it needed improving, or it was a dealer item that was dropped from inventory. Many times it comes from trying new mods on their own cars and they willingly share with the rest of us. Some of these gus have sacrificed a lot of HARD work for the Fiero community and don't always get the credit they deserve, including some you haven't listed. I won't attempt to list them, because it may start a little disagreement, but we know who they all are. It isn't a short list.||||reg||1
